    "body": "## Chat03 private-alpha policy and staging gate (proposal only)\n\n**Base:** `main@1e05ffd7b65bdd5d775638e5e524e125a9ce0f07`  \n**Head:** `0ee4d07dc00bbc2530393faa5013df9502648766`  \n**Only changed file:** `gameplay-server/PRIVATE_ALPHA_GATE.md` (new, 108 lines).\n\n### Purpose\nDefine a reviewable, explicitly **not-yet-approved** owner decision ledger and sequential safety gates after PRs #440-#447 integrated. Avoid the dangerous inference that local Worker/D1 tests, automatic Pages publication, or battle-scoped capabilities equal production-ready identity or private-alpha authorization.\n\n### Content\n- Verifies exact main, Chat03 local CI (61/61 Python and local workerd/D1 0001-0007), deployed Pages vs undeployed gameplay Worker/D1.\n- Nine *OPEN* owner decisions (invite/trust, player identity/second device, admin key custody, bearer recovery, AES keyring backup, separate gameplay-data retention, isolated staging D1, checkpoint+restore+fail-closed, browser/release acceptance). Recommendations are explicitly proposals, **not** accepted values.\n- Gates G0-G5: source check PASS; policy, hosted authorization and tested backup/restore BLOCKED; remote synthetic Worker and Safari/real-player acceptance NOT STARTED.\n- Non-destructive operator STOP/runbook for ambiguous Cloudflare IDs, lost responses, restore/keyring failures, credential incidents, and telemetry D1 isolation. Never publish secrets or reuse telemetry storage.\n- No implicit authorization to use Cloudflare, deploy, migrate, invite actual players, merge other PRs, change Chat04/Chat05/Stage7.15, or select a retention period.\n\n### Evidence and bounds\n- Compared exact head to exact main: **ahead 1, behind 0**, exactly one added Markdown file; no source/config/SQL/tests/workflows changed.\n- No production or staging resource inspection/mutation; this is a docs-only decision proposal.\n- [Tracking issue #439](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/issues/439); [canonical checkpoint plan](https://app.notion.com/p/3fa815ae752f810187b9eeeabdab6d2b); [actual local CI](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/40659349212).\n\n**Review requested:** verify that recommendations are clearly non-binding, source facts are correct, and all data-loss/credential risks remain blocked. Keep Draft until reviewed. The owner separately approves choices and manually merges; this PR itself does not authorize hosted actions.",
